# The pre-commit hook runs `prettier --write` over every staged file matching
# its glob, and `yaml` is in that glob. Left to itself prettier reformats
# pnpm-lock.yaml — it grew by 2-4 KB the one time it happened — and rewrites
# CHANGELOG.md's bullets from `*` to `-` on every release, fighting Release
# Please for a file Release Please owns. Neither file is written by hand, so
# neither is prettier's to format.
pnpm-lock.yaml
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
CHANGELOG.md
